  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"PsulB\" id=\"PsulB\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1757318160763-5d6132c7-f880-412a-b002-79a0416eb802.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1fb12dd9-7458-4536-982b-db6c30a5de4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u61fe73c7-7807-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A619.5555555555555%2C%22height%22%3A294%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A342589%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1394%2C%22originHeight%22%3A661%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BE%BF%E7%89%9B(HARDWARE%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A464%2C%22width%22%3A390%2C%22height%22%3A51%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BE%BF%E7%89%9BHARDWARE%22%2C%22x%22%3A935%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A274%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A917%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A301%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A981%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A980%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%E8%A3%B8%E6%9C%BA)%22%2C%22x%22%3A236%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LINUX%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1188%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u84cc21a5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></h1><h1 data-lake-id=\"rLk0w\" id=\"rLk0w\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e54e9a8\" id=\"u8e54e9a8\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">驱动的作用</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ueaed2f2b\" id=\"ueaed2f2b\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc45f8936\" id=\"uc45f8936\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">驱动是直接和硬件打交道的,是底层硬件和上层软件的桥梁</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u492df084\" id=\"u492df084\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1757256547344-7259a4b8-fce8-4ecf-9fd0-133efbd635c7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u50218b34-cd2e-43f4-a257-bfc4bc3f272%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u01c24c6d-2737-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A459.1111111111111%2C%22height%22%3A134%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A385937%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1033%2C%22originHeight%22%3A302%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%235993ba%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0e881e56%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"vGXxH\" id=\"vGXxH\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1dc98b28\" id=\"u1dc98b28\">无操作系统时的驱动</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uf2858bbe\" id=\"uf2858bbe\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u327d8dff\" id=\"u327d8dff\">有时候并不一定需要操作系统,比如用单片机进行简单的通断控制,从编程的角度来说,直接控制寄存器就可以了,也就是直接和硬件打交道</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"QtCsU\" id=\"QtCsU\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47751e62\" id=\"u47751e62\">有操作系统时的驱动(Linux系统)</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uc563fb58\" id=\"uc563fb58\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41c1135c\" id=\"u41c1135c\">要基于Linux的各种驱动框架进行编程,当驱动都按照系统给出的框架进行编程以后,就可以提供一个统一的接口给应用程序调用</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufe6c1a69\" id=\"ufe6c1a69\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1757256712051-35141081-84e5-4743-9191-b7918d248d84.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub6c60bfd-d30d-43bc-b4ad-80845c58284%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u01c24c6d-2737-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A128.44444444444446%2C%22height%22%3A233%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A58065%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A289%2C%22originHeight%22%3A525%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A111%2C%22y%22%3A463%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A114%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A111%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8A%22%2C%22x%22%3A127%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AA%22%2C%22x%22%3A128%2C%22y%22%3A391%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0a64a%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub4f03153%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"udA4S\" id=\"udA4S\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u134354f7\" id=\"u134354f7\">驱动分类</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ub453d3d2\" id=\"ub453d3d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e14d981\" id=\"u9e14d981\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">Linux将驱动分为</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3760b642\" id=\"u3760b642\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">字符设备</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8e306f45\" id=\"u8e306f45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf8106a29\" id=\"uf8106a29\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">网络设备</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf3fda054\" id=\"uf3fda054\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u62ac220f\" id=\"u62ac220f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">块设备</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf907c1e3\" id=\"uf907c1e3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">三类。</span></p><ul list=\"u3eb703b6\"><li fid=\"ucb8728e2\" data-lake-id=\"ubc84f98c\" id=\"ubc84f98c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0cd9015\" id=\"ub0cd9015\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">字符设备指那些必须以串行顺序依次进行访问的设备，如鼠标。</span></li><li fid=\"ucb8728e2\" data-lake-id=\"uce08a2b4\" id=\"uce08a2b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u111fec53\" id=\"u111fec53\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">块设备可以按照任意顺序进行访问，如硬盘。</span></li><li fid=\"ucb8728e2\" data-lake-id=\"uedac76fb\" id=\"uedac76fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc03aca69\" id=\"uc03aca69\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">网络设备是面向数据包的接收和发送。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uf187e512\" id=\"uf187e512\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F34933095%2F1757256810952-5b386cc6-518a-45a4-a8d7-ef4da443c8d0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0a56edf5-c523-4615-bed7-6f45ed91896%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u01c24c6d-2737-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A676.4444444444445%2C%22height%22%3A164%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A274640%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1522%2C%22originHeight%22%3A369%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23afab9d%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8536a778%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u57d779b1\" id=\"u57d779b1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u890f2adf\" id=\"u890f2adf\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f3b4d90\" id=\"u4f3b4d90\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubccd6d3c\" id=\"ubccd6d3c\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u023ac3f2\" id=\"u023ac3f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p>",
